<div class="flex flex-col gap-5 bg-base-200 p-6 sm:p-8 lg:col-span-8 lg:p-10" role="status">
  <p class="mono text-base-content/70">Request received</p>
  <p class="text-3xl leading-tight font-light tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-4xl">Thank you, {{ record.name }}.</p>
  <p class="text-lg text-pretty text-base-content/80">Teresa will call you within two working days to arrange the visit{% if record.visit %}, on a {{ record.visit | downcase }} if that still suits you{% endif %}.</p>
  <p class="text-pretty text-base-content/80">The form can't take photos. If you have a few of the rooms, or plans or old drawings of the house, send them to <a href="mailto:office@ostromkemp.com" class="link">office@ostromkemp.com</a>: they help us come prepared.</p>
</div>
